{"lines": [{"text": "A hot dog and a soda for just $1.50.", "start": 0.6, "end": 4.176, "spec": null, "words": [["A", 0.091, 0.114], ["hot", 0.114, 0.375], ["dog", 0.375, 0.614], ["and", 0.625, 0.67], ["a", 0.682, 0.716], ["soda", 0.716, 1.182], ["for", 1.386, 1.545], ["just", 1.545, 1.852], ["$1.50", 1.852, 3.239]]}, {"text": "At Costco, that price has not changed since 1985.", "start": 4.9, "end": 8.5, "spec": null, "words": [["At", 0.091, 0.17], ["Costco", 0.17, 0.75], ["that", 0.92, 1.034], ["price", 1.045, 1.295], ["has", 1.307, 1.409], ["not", 1.409, 1.705], ["changed", 1.716, 2.193], ["since 1985", 2.205, 3.273]]}, {"text": "Adjusted for inflation, it would cost more than four dollars today.", "start": 8.75, "end": 12.518, "spec": null, "words": [["Adjusted", 0.091, 0.477], ["for", 0.477, 0.614], ["inflation", 0.614, 1.148], ["it", 1.58, 1.625], ["would", 1.625, 1.727], ["cost", 1.739, 2.068], ["more", 2.068, 2.295], ["than", 2.295, 2.409], ["four", 2.409, 2.739], ["dollars", 2.739, 3.068], ["today", 3.068, 3.432]]}, {"text": "Meat, buns, wages and rent all got pricier, so each combo probably earns close to nothing.", "start": 12.768, "end": 18.6, "spec": null, "words": [["Meat", 0.08, 0.352], ["buns", 0.375, 0.875], ["wages", 1.102, 1.648], ["and", 1.648, 1.795], ["rent", 1.795, 2.068], ["all", 2.182, 2.398], ["got", 2.398, 2.58], ["pricier", 2.58, 3.136], ["so", 3.489, 3.67], ["each", 3.67, 3.83], ["combo", 3.841, 4.25], ["probably", 4.25, 4.614], ["earns", 4.614, 4.83], ["close", 4.83, 5.057], ["to", 5.057, 5.114], ["nothing", 5.114, 5.489]]}, {"text": "Yet the chain sells roughly 200 million of them every year.", "start": 18.85, "end": 22.714, "spec": null, "words": [["Yet", 0.08, 0.17], ["the", 0.182, 0.261], ["chain", 0.261, 0.545], ["sells", 0.545, 0.932], ["roughly", 0.943, 1.386], ["200", 1.523, 2.023], ["million", 2.023, 2.33], ["of", 2.341, 2.42], ["them", 2.42, 2.636], ["every", 2.898, 3.148], ["year", 3.159, 3.523]]}, {"text": "That is called a loss leader, a deal so good that it pulls you through the door.", "start": 22.964, "end": 27.404, "spec": null, "words": [["That", 0.091, 0.159], ["is", 0.159, 0.239], ["called", 0.239, 0.386], ["a", 0.386, 0.432], ["loss", 0.432, 0.852], ["leader", 0.864, 1.295], ["a", 1.705, 1.818], ["deal", 1.864, 2.17], ["so", 2.182, 2.625], ["good", 2.625, 2.977], ["that", 2.977, 3.068], ["it", 3.068, 3.148], ["pulls", 3.159, 3.443], ["you", 3.443, 3.511], ["through", 3.511, 3.67], ["the", 3.67, 3.739], ["door", 3.739, 4.114]]}, {"text": "And once you are inside, you rarely leave with just a hot dog.", "start": 27.654, "end": 31.206, "spec": null, "words": [["And", 0.091, 0.17], ["once", 0.17, 0.318], ["you", 0.33, 0.409], ["are", 0.409, 0.511], ["inside", 0.523, 1.068], ["you", 1.443, 1.636], ["rarely", 1.648, 2.023], ["leave", 2.023, 2.364], ["with", 2.364, 2.455], ["just", 2.455, 2.602], ["a", 2.602, 2.625], ["hot", 2.625, 2.875], ["dog", 2.875, 3.227]]}, {"text": "But here is the real trick: you had to pay just to walk in.", "start": 31.456, "end": 34.528, "spec": null, "words": [["But", 0.102, 0.17], ["here", 0.17, 0.352], ["is", 0.352, 0.432], ["the", 0.432, 0.523], ["real", 0.534, 0.92], ["trick", 0.932, 1.307], ["you", 1.693, 1.773], ["had", 1.784, 1.909], ["to", 1.909, 1.943], ["pay", 1.943, 2.136], ["just", 2.136, 2.261], ["to", 2.261, 2.307], ["walk", 2.307, 2.58], ["in", 2.58, 2.739]]}, {"text": "A basic membership costs about $65 a year.", "start": 34.778, "end": 38.114, "spec": null, "words": [["A", 0.091, 0.148], ["basic", 0.159, 0.511], ["membership", 0.511, 0.92], ["costs", 0.932, 1.295], ["about", 1.295, 1.5], ["$65", 1.511, 2.602], ["a", 2.602, 2.625], ["year", 2.625, 3.0]]}, {"text": "Around 80 million households pay that fee.", "start": 38.364, "end": 41.196, "spec": null, "words": [["Around", 0.091, 0.398], ["80", 0.534, 0.761], ["million", 0.761, 1.057], ["households", 1.057, 1.625], ["pay", 1.716, 1.977], ["that", 1.977, 2.159], ["fee", 2.159, 2.489]]}, {"text": "And roughly nine out of ten of them renew.", "start": 41.446, "end": 43.774, "spec": null, "words": [["And", 0.08, 0.193], ["roughly", 0.523, 0.807], ["nine", 0.818, 1.091], ["out", 1.091, 1.17], ["of", 1.182, 1.239], ["ten", 1.25, 1.409], ["of", 1.409, 1.455], ["them", 1.455, 1.591], ["renew", 1.591, 2.0]]}, {"text": "Together, those fees bring in about $5 billion a year.", "start": 44.024, "end": 47.696, "spec": null, "words": [["Together", 0.08, 0.489], ["those", 0.727, 0.955], ["fees", 0.955, 1.284], ["bring", 1.284, 1.557], ["in", 1.625, 1.716], ["about", 1.716, 1.955], ["$5 billion", 1.966, 2.943], ["a", 2.943, 2.966], ["year", 2.966, 3.33]]}, {"text": "That is equal to roughly two thirds of the company's entire yearly profit.", "start": 47.946, "end": 52.266, "spec": null, "words": [["That", 0.091, 0.159], ["is", 0.159, 0.261], ["equal", 0.261, 0.5], ["to", 0.5, 0.58], ["roughly", 0.58, 1.125], ["two", 1.25, 1.523], ["thirds", 1.523, 2.023], ["of", 2.023, 2.068], ["the", 2.068, 2.136], ["company's", 2.136, 2.534], ["entire", 2.545, 3.205], ["yearly", 3.205, 3.489], ["profit", 3.489, 3.977]]}, {"text": "So the shelves can run on thin margins, and the hot dog becomes pure advertising.", "start": 52.516, "end": 57.796, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.193], ["the", 0.193, 0.261], ["shelves", 0.261, 0.591], ["can", 0.602, 0.773], ["run", 0.773, 1.0], ["on", 1.0, 1.205], ["thin", 1.261, 1.58], ["margins", 1.58, 2.227], ["and", 2.545, 2.625], ["the", 2.625, 2.682], ["hot", 2.682, 2.989], ["dog", 2.989, 3.33], ["becomes", 3.33, 3.693], ["pure", 3.705, 4.193], ["advertising", 4.273, 4.932]]}, {"text": "A co-founder reportedly warned his successor that if he ever raised the hot dog price, he would kill him.", "start": 58.046, "end": 63.566, "spec": null, "words": [["A", 0.08, 0.125], ["co-founder", 0.125, 0.67], ["reportedly", 0.67, 1.205], ["warned", 1.205, 1.545], ["his", 1.545, 1.636], ["successor", 1.648, 2.216], ["that", 2.227, 2.33], ["if", 2.33, 2.386], ["he", 2.398, 2.523], ["ever", 2.58, 2.852], ["raised", 2.852, 3.17], ["the", 3.182, 3.227], ["hot", 3.227, 3.523], ["dog", 3.523, 3.761], ["price", 3.773, 4.25], ["he", 4.591, 4.648], ["would", 4.648, 4.784], ["kill", 4.784, 5.023], ["him", 5.023, 5.182]]}, {"text": "The hot dog is not the product, your membership is.", "start": 63.816, "end": 66.936, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.102, 0.148], ["hot", 0.148, 0.352], ["dog", 0.352, 0.568], ["is", 0.568, 0.67], ["not", 0.67, 1.0], ["the", 1.0, 1.068], ["product", 1.08, 1.523], ["your", 1.773, 1.841], ["membership", 1.841, 2.33], ["is", 2.341, 2.773]]}, {"text": "Would you pay a yearly fee just to shop cheaper?", "start": 67.186, "end": 69.754, "spec": null, "words": [["Would", 0.091, 0.182], ["you", 0.182, 0.239], ["pay", 0.239, 0.398], ["a", 0.398, 0.432], ["yearly", 0.443, 0.818], ["fee", 0.818, 1.261], ["just", 1.409, 1.58], ["to", 1.58, 1.625], ["shop", 1.625, 1.875], ["cheaper", 1.886, 2.239]]}], "dur": 71.55}